{"kind":"html","caption":"用单调递增栈保存仍可能向右扩展的柱子下标；遇到更矮的柱子时，连续弹栈并确定被弹柱子的最大宽度。动画用示例 [2,1,5,6,2,3] 展示关键入栈、出栈与面积更新过程，末尾追加高度 0 的哨兵以结算剩余柱子。最大矩形覆盖高度为 5 的两根柱子，面积为 5 × 2 = 10。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>柱状图中最大的矩形</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}main{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px;display:grid;gap:8px}.card{background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px}.head{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;align-items:center}h1{font-size:14px;margin:0;font-weight:600}.mono,.num{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px}.badge{background:#252526;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 7px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;font-size:10px}.accent{color:#3794ff}.chart-wrap{overflow-x:auto;padding:4px 0}.chart{height:160px;min-width:100%;display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:flex-end;border-bottom:1px solid #3c3c3c;padding:0 4px 4px}.column{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;gap:4px;height:100%;flex:1;min-width:38px}.bar-space{height:120px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end}.bar{width:100%;min-height:2px;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px 4px 0 0;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center;padding-top:2px;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:10px;transition:.35s}.column.current .bar{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}.column.range .bar{background:#694f1d;border-color:#d7a52a}.column.popped .bar{background:#63333a;border-color:#d16969}.meta{min-height:28px;text-align:center;font-size:10px}.idx{color:#9cdcfe}.pointer{color:#3794ff;font-weight:600;min-height:12px}.panels{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px}.label{color:#9cdcfe;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px}.stack{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;min-height:40px}.stack-item{background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;padding:4px 6px;font-size:10px}.stack-item:last-child{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}.small{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}.formula{font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}.result{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:6px}.metric{background:#252526;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;font-size:10px}.metric strong{display:block;margin-top:4px;font-size:13px;color:#d4d4d4}.progress{height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:8px}.progress>div{height:100%;background:#3794ff;transition:width .4s}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}.dot{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:2px;margin-right:4px}.note{color:#8d8d8d;line-height:1.45;font-size:12px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<section class=\"card head\"><div><h1>单调栈扫描示例</h1><div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">输入 <span class=\"mono\">[2, 1, 5, 6, 2, 3]</span>，末尾加入哨兵 <span class=\"mono\">0</span></div></div><div class=\"badge\">步骤 <span id=\"stepNo\" class=\"mono accent\">1 / 12</span></div></section>\n<section class=\"card\"><div class=\"label\">柱状图与当前扫描位置</div><div class=\"chart-wrap\"><div id=\"chart\" class=\"chart\"></div></div><div class=\"legend\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><span><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#0e639c\"></i>当前柱</span><span><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#694f1d\"></i>本次矩形范围</span><span><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#63333a\"></i>正在出栈</span></div></section>\n<section class=\"panels\"><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"label\">递增栈（左 → 右为栈底 → 栈顶）</div><div id=\"stack\" class=\"stack\"></div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"label\">本步动作</div><div id=\"action\" class=\"formula\"></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"card result\"><div class=\"metric\"><span class=\"small\">当前下标 i</span><strong id=\"current\" class=\"mono\">0</strong></div><div class=\"metric\"><span class=\"small\">本次候选面积</span><strong id=\"candidate\" class=\"mono\">—</strong></div><div class=\"metric\"><span class=\"small\">历史最大面积</span><strong id=\"best\" class=\"mono accent\">0</strong></div></section>\n<section class=\"card\"><div class=\"progress\"><div id=\"progress\"></div></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"note\">栈中柱高保持递增。每根柱子只入栈、出栈各一次，因此总时间复杂度为 O(n)。</p></section>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst heights=[2,1,5,6,2,3,0];\nconst steps=[\n {i:0,s:[0],a:'高度 2 不小于栈顶，入栈下标 0。',c:'—',b:0},\n {i:1,s:[],a:'1 < 2，弹出下标 0。左侧无更矮柱，宽度 = 1。',c:'2 × 1 = 2',b:2,p:0,r:[0,0]},\n {i:1,s:[1],a:'弹栈结束，将下标 1 入栈。',c:'—',b:2},\n {i:2,s:[1,2],a:'5 ≥ 1，将下标 2 入栈。',c:'—',b:2},\n {i:3,s:[1,2,3],a:'6 ≥ 5，将下标 3 入栈。',c:'—',b:2},\n {i:4,s:[1,2],a:'2 < 6，弹出下标 3；左界为 2，宽度 = 1。',c:'6 × 1 = 6',b:6,p:3,r:[3,3]},\n {i:4,s:[1],a:'2 仍小于栈顶高度 5，再弹出下标 2；宽度 = 4 − 1 − 1 = 2。',c:'5 × 2 = 10',b:10,p:2,r:[2,3]},\n {i:4,s:[1,4],a:'栈顶高度 1 更矮，将下标 4 入栈。',c:'—',b:10},\n {i:5,s:[1,4,5],a:'3 ≥ 2，将下标 5 入栈。',c:'—',b:10},\n {i:6,s:[1,4],a:'哨兵 0 到达，弹出高度 3；宽度 = 1。',c:'3 × 1 = 3',b:10,p:5,r:[5,5]},\n {i:6,s:[1],a:'继续弹出高度 2；它可扩展到下标 2…5，宽度 = 4。',c:'2 × 4 = 8',b:10,p:4,r:[2,5]},\n {i:6,s:[],a:'最后弹出高度 1。扫描完成，最大面积保持为 10。',c:'1 × 6 = 6',b:10,p:1,r:[0,5]}\n];\nconst chart=document.getElementById('chart');\nheights.forEach((h,i)=>{const col=document.createElement('div');col.className='column';col.innerHTML=`<div class=\"bar-space\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"height:${Math.max(h*32,2)}px\">${h}</div></div><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"idx mono\">下标 ${i}</span><span class=\"pointer\"></span></div>`;chart.appendChild(col)});\nfunction render(k){const x=steps[k];document.getElementById('stepNo').textContent=`${k+1} / ${steps.length}`;document.getElementById('current').textContent=x.i;document.getElementById('candidate').textContent=x.c;document.getElementById('best').textContent=x.b;document.getElementById('action').innerHTML=x.a.replace(/(10|6 × 1 = 6|5 × 2 = 10)/g,'<span class=\"accent mono\">$1</span>');document.getElementById('progress').style.width=`${(k+1)/steps.length*100}%`;\n [...chart.children].forEach((el,i)=>{el.className='column';el.querySelector('.pointer').textContent=i===x.i?'当前 i':'';if(x.r&&i>=x.r[0]&&i<=x.r[1])el.classList.add('range');if(i===x.p)el.classList.add('popped');if(i===x.i)el.classList.add('current')});\n const stack=document.getElementById('stack');stack.innerHTML='';if(!x.s.length){stack.innerHTML='<span class=\"small\">空栈</span>'}else{x.s.forEach(i=>{const item=document.createElement('div');item.className='stack-item';item.innerHTML=`<span class=\"mono\">下标 ${i}</span><span class=\"small mono\">高度 ${heights[i]}</span>`;stack.appendChild(item)})}\n document.getElementById('note').textContent=k===6?'高度 5 的柱子左边遇到高度 1，右边遇到高度 2，所以最大宽度正好是 2。':k===steps.length-1?'结论：最大矩形覆盖下标 2…3，高度 5、宽度 2，面积为 10。':'栈中柱高保持递增；遇到更矮柱时，栈顶柱子的右边界随之确定。'}\nlet k=0;render(k);setInterval(()=>{k=(k+1)%steps.length;render(k)},2100);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}